                <l xml:id="m-ba40b51b-dd46-46e5-a31d-7904f851da83" facs="#m-3b15aab2-f675-4174-96cf-5a5b90029dcf" label="ambiguous">787</l><l xml:id="m-9f42e286-1bf5-4637-b944-d0fac8a31047" facs="#m-9a9e995b-9817-407f-8b02-524b87b46741" label="ambiguous">Easter Monday.</l><l xml:id="m-1aefc348-370a-499a-b542-94dee9c83e6e" facs="#m-80c1afdf-8826-4cd1-9285-1c4e6029367b" label="ambiguous">† Sequentia sancti Evangelli secundum Lucam. Luc. 24. b.</l><l xml:id="m-9ed25528-a504-44ad-96eb-38aeed9ba39e" facs="#m-44dd12bc-12c0-47d5-b516-e034c6881f49" label="lyrics-like">N illo témpore: Duo ex discipulis! qui dicunt eum vívere. Et abiérunt</l><l xml:id="m-291946c3-5028-4c56-8f96-4d79240f9cd1" facs="#m-c9d33516-3882-4505-8593-1a6acdbf8365" label="lyrics-like">L Jesu ibant ipsa die in castéllum.</l><l xml:id="m-1ff3798a-e786-4f94-8cee-c37c74766fa3" facs="#m-1a3cf76a-1170-4154-899b-486833c4cb74" label="lyrics-like">quidam ex nostris ad monuméntum:</l><l xml:id="m-944d316b-467e-484c-a768-0d315d622dce" facs="#m-4d7c2eb3-c51c-404d-a401-7f3f432a0b7b" label="lyrics-like">quod erat in spátio stadiórum se¬</l><l xml:id="m-63fe1c32-9733-4cd7-b083-a1b44ffb9c81" facs="#m-b89fb3cd-75d8-47f3-907b-770f3dc84f36" label="lyrics-like">et ita invenérunt sicut mulieres di¬</l><l xml:id="m-40cb345e-326d-4012-bdef-e8122d7f88ec" facs="#m-e22630ed-f62e-429a-a42b-74b4ff71909d" label="lyrics-like">xagínta ab Jerúsalem, nómine</l><l xml:id="m-0b08b53c-de8a-42ef-a814-021318054df5" facs="#m-fdaffa00-d56e-4904-b0ab-8a8adc6ee98d" label="lyrics-like">xérunt, ipsum vero non invenérunt.</l><l xml:id="m-181c4e4c-ed2a-4fbc-9643-c085f741ccac" facs="#m-5faf59bf-eb00-45fb-af7b-1d72e90d0deb" label="lyrics-like">Emmaus. Et ipsi loquebántur ad</l><l xml:id="m-6f59ce72-74e8-4ed3-a8bf-fb858bced08e" facs="#m-264c5125-a274-48b2-aa4b-07a2e522eeb9" label="ambiguous">Et ipse dixit ad eos: O stulti, et</l><l xml:id="m-c9da50f9-6a6d-4cb4-98fb-46019be8cee2" facs="#m-d812929d-3cb4-42eb-a5a3-4d320051aa79" label="lyrics-like">invicem de his ómnibus, quae acci¬</l><l xml:id="m-ebb9ae6a-39b5-4a2e-aefd-4278643b04e3" facs="#m-f3447075-2ada-4b0b-9791-9dc2e2d1680f" label="lyrics-like">tardi corde ad credéndum in ómni¬</l><l xml:id="m-d96bcc66-76bd-4c7d-a066-9bb1bef6ddfa" facs="#m-12a47e23-2c96-4364-92af-1999e8f5a327" label="ambiguous">derant. Et factum est, dum fabula¬</l><l xml:id="m-0e0217e3-ad87-4d33-8814-21286a195a11" facs="#m-b10e6db1-c2db-4604-b1cb-1b3b0fee392b" label="lyrics-like">bus, quae locúti sunt prophétae!</l><l xml:id="m-8e34f94d-4de7-4f81-8d9e-cca0e146c8d3" facs="#m-e1818f40-437e-499e-bc56-ed33354e86a0" label="lyrics-like">réntur, et secum quaérerent: et</l><l xml:id="m-ba478cda-bd65-424b-a1f5-9178f3e6ece6" facs="#m-c816009c-56f3-4b4d-bd89-9e63b3f8d966" label="lyrics-like">Nonné haec opórtuit pati Christum,</l><l xml:id="m-4f72df7e-6741-4741-b047-3965c6402778" facs="#m-2bea1886-3c01-455f-ba77-70c133c71701" label="lyrics-like">et ita intrâre in glóriam suam? Et</l><l xml:id="m-7df090fd-2193-4835-bf4d-8e78d40fd605" facs="#m-4514944a-2441-4805-a308-d2dddc4e00b1" label="ambiguous">ipse Jesus appropinquans ibat cum</l><l xml:id="m-55be5f3f-867b-471b-9fbb-8c9923eb7dea" facs="#m-5f731e06-56ac-47d1-b4d9-624e92b7a7ef" label="lyrics-like">incipiens a Móyse, et ómnibus pro¬</l><l xml:id="m-14f8e758-dcb7-43bd-b6ba-28788480756a" facs="#m-0a3c6a3e-b507-401d-8be7-bfc34bd886f6" label="lyrics-like">illis ? óculi autem ilfórum tenebán¬</l><l xml:id="m-c8a598df-8dbc-45d2-a821-9b0a65305e83" facs="#m-1241c93a-479f-489d-93fb-1b9cfa02ca8a" label="lyrics-like">phétis, interpretabátur illis in ómni¬</l><l xml:id="m-8754bb31-3bde-438e-8fc8-19fe8f8a625c" facs="#m-fb3c3c57-609c-4636-a74f-36f0fc7abb3b" label="lyrics-like">tur, ne eum agnóscerent. Et ait ad</l><l xml:id="m-b3102172-3bad-4734-b86b-ad3751e99670" facs="#m-c6245d6b-dced-4d0d-a350-bd90ddf1a0c1" label="lyrics-like">illos : Qui sunt hi sermónes, quos</l><l xml:id="m-fe3a239c-acc5-4f3d-be0e-eba08f3ef9f2" facs="#m-a4119a78-7552-477e-94d9-6505e9a24544" label="lyrics-like">bus scriptúris, quae de ipso erant.</l><l xml:id="m-0990a5d5-b83a-4ad9-a056-197e50a39e5d" facs="#m-ff11dfb2-e678-4cb1-bf7a-3977c35c7d5c" label="lyrics-like">confértis ad invicem ambulántes, et</l><l xml:id="m-0709f5ad-3522-4abe-ba0f-a16d7046fac4" facs="#m-7cfba06a-8971-4b2c-84e1-425f0eb9ae59" label="lyrics-like">Et appropinquavérunt castéllo, quo</l><l xml:id="m-0ecdd8af-96e4-4b44-b59a-02a93fa89136" facs="#m-d69416cc-bb27-4af3-ae8e-17b35b9aa005" label="lyrics-like">ibant: et ipse se finxit lóngius ire.</l><l xml:id="m-9566da33-ee56-4c36-a723-5425ef0297d8" facs="#m-8cd4dce8-0b6a-4dee-b707-c3dfd1fd544b" label="lyrics-like">estis tristes? Et respóndens unus,</l><l xml:id="m-eb1dc958-8a7a-430c-8d54-2214728c0b10" facs="#m-9852f62e-6d83-4121-9699-d61c5abfc983" label="lyrics-like">cui nomen Cléophas, dixit ei: Tu</l><l xml:id="m-532b6513-ed27-4173-8728-0176b09e95ca" facs="#m-d82c7779-33c2-4b3e-9bc5-6ea826b0f82f" label="lyrics-like">Et coegérunt illum, dicéntes: Mane</l><l xml:id="m-c468c4fa-27ba-40c1-9b8e-3f492b2e5a72" facs="#m-f82760f7-9b66-47fc-b4e8-7525d943ebcc" label="lyrics-like">solus peregrínus es in Jerúsalem, et</l><l xml:id="m-e0c99982-d77a-48de-91e4-fb2f68ab5a3a" facs="#m-4113c73f-e8ec-4a1b-b09c-eeb8b0707099" label="lyrics-like">nobíscum, quóniam advesperáscit,</l><l xml:id="m-b0513506-30ca-46ee-b712-b2714293aeda" facs="#m-1860c7f7-bf1e-4ef7-a464-03ee8bb5392b" label="lyrics-like">et inclináta est jam dies. Et intrávit</l><l xml:id="m-812bc880-fdbc-4960-a178-005b13b28c6d" facs="#m-6be3157f-5937-4ff9-9bf1-eee9d59a0421" label="lyrics-like">non cognovísti quae facta sunt in</l><l xml:id="m-aa30bf19-9db6-48af-b2a2-ad04ee41ac2a" facs="#m-14f3fa0c-8821-41bf-9410-671fc2294b19" label="lyrics-like">illa his diébus? Quibus ille dixit:</l><l xml:id="m-37e4e7c5-0a1c-4ddc-b02b-1c4a0f76f817" facs="#m-ee85061f-73b7-4f62-8645-cff6219225ec" label="ambiguous">cum illis. Et factum est, dum re¬</l><l xml:id="m-1274a526-200d-4326-9ac7-7b942064dd5f" facs="#m-a5f0d394-3f5c-4f57-a8ef-65a219b608bf" label="lyrics-like">Quae? Et dixérunt : De Jesu Na¬</l><l xml:id="m-18ebff8c-2045-45d4-99f4-80805cb156a4" facs="#m-0b2563bf-b555-4b4e-9ca5-8dbe17f7a261" label="lyrics-like">cúmberet cum eis, accépit panem,</l><l xml:id="m-70fe20f6-d1e1-4e91-a4d6-65971b12324c" facs="#m-4d50500a-46c9-40d7-b64c-6c32469afd85" label="lyrics-like">zaréno, qui fuit vir prophéta potens</l><l xml:id="m-5e4a4535-3d95-48d7-b4b2-edc030eaa62f" facs="#m-51e8666a-1c06-4453-ab3b-bce43ecf8096" label="lyrics-like">et benedixit, ac fregit, et porrigé¬</l><l xml:id="m-6ee3b83e-f54b-4f10-a84b-4090489b981c" facs="#m-8fa638de-658a-4b41-ae34-4f46ded2f2e0" label="lyrics-like">bat illis. Et apérti sunt óculi eórum,</l><l xml:id="m-2fd5d7ad-c57b-4f51-8d4b-82d84a560459" facs="#m-9d0a7d08-da4f-4aec-a373-43b22eebe3a2" label="lyrics-like">in ópere et sermóne, coram Deo, et</l><l xml:id="m-559bef1f-46a8-4ed0-9204-4a58fc3a4f67" facs="#m-b62c6b4d-6143-4584-bdaa-69f71e3a4a38" label="lyrics-like">omni pópulo: et quómodo eum</l><l xml:id="m-7ecb84e0-15fc-4a7a-9fe9-6a3440bb2fa0" facs="#m-dede3fda-26b1-4e60-9cf7-fdf58678c7c3" label="lyrics-like">et cognovérunt eum; et ipse evánuit</l><l xml:id="m-5ab870eb-64b5-4f17-8e87-9f9d3f2b575d" facs="#m-bfcefd00-90e8-4201-9c70-27fbbaf956ea" label="lyrics-like">ex óculis eórum. Et dixérunt ad in¬</l><l xml:id="m-85562c92-3144-4c92-9613-b39868bc10ad" facs="#m-a17270a3-e9d5-4750-aef6-c82e1f1ae695" label="lyrics-like">tradidérunt summi sacerdótes, et</l><l xml:id="m-b8948d22-08b9-463f-bfe2-839a57dea73f" facs="#m-b4664dd6-315d-442a-8f35-5bde1b689592" label="lyrics-like">principes nostri in damnatiónem</l><l xml:id="m-1955c9ac-c3b6-4e6a-b044-025593287edc" facs="#m-65ae5bf3-140f-472f-b97b-a84ae4f325e3" label="ambiguous">vicem: Nonne cor nostrum ardens</l><l xml:id="m-af149fa9-bb4f-490c-b027-aa7a2b095330" facs="#m-f40211e8-ab0c-41de-b01c-49fce95c5ae2" label="lyrics-like">mortis, et crucifixérunt eum. Nos</l><l xml:id="m-56a6fd0f-2c06-4645-8b45-00f2fe51be45" facs="#m-c9c61356-3511-49a8-a1dc-6a674b23c389" label="lyrics-like">erat in nobis, dum loquerétur in via,</l><l xml:id="m-53635785-84c1-4dea-a354-ac8bef08679b" facs="#m-d041ce4e-6427-4cf0-9224-c47dfe147d53" label="lyrics-like">et aperiret nobis Scriptúras? Et sur¬</l><l xml:id="m-81590936-19e3-4541-8ba2-94dbc097c076" facs="#m-1c18acf4-47ac-4cf6-9000-b81bea155d7a" label="lyrics-like">autem sperabámus, quia ipse esset</l><l xml:id="m-fa24230c-6ce6-4f82-92ab-fec26f2f4972" facs="#m-b0455fde-1bc9-46e7-b1ef-5197ba2ffeaf" label="lyrics-like">géntes eádem hora regréssi sunt in</l><l xml:id="m-722c73f1-1b3f-4766-8384-17a329ed561e" facs="#m-417f40a3-47ec-488b-bb1d-dad0cd41a2c0" label="lyrics-like">redemptúrus Israel; et nunc super</l><l xml:id="m-ee1b63f0-1978-4355-84a2-a64fc8d3a2af" facs="#m-8523d284-cf32-4501-a34f-336528779e00" label="lyrics-like">Jerúsalem; et invenérunt congre¬</l><l xml:id="m-d4dd0d00-44f1-4120-9e88-244be7afd30e" facs="#m-736ab333-2cb0-4067-bf7f-f90a62756bd4" label="lyrics-like">haec ómnia, tértia dies est hódie,</l><l xml:id="m-42cf1368-1340-44e1-98bc-1744b6d3f31c" facs="#m-5ee98037-4ed6-4d90-9565-635dc9107eed" label="lyrics-like">gátos úndecim et eos, qui cum illis</l><l xml:id="m-301c23b8-5c36-406c-a760-7ae7876dcb8b" facs="#m-57b23cf2-13ab-4c04-ad8f-c0c1ccaa664b" label="ambiguous">quod haec facta sunt. Sed et mulie¬</l><l xml:id="m-d353f3df-3e09-43c2-90fd-e5a3575513df" facs="#m-16e14b65-472c-4855-8e5a-51de101ff83b" label="lyrics-like">erant, dicéntes: Quod surréxit Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-8b67768d-49f5-42d4-9012-6b2fa68ebd71" facs="#m-3865c006-c81e-4f5d-b720-5dfa6bbe89d4" label="lyrics-like">res quaedam ex nostris terruérunt</l><l xml:id="m-42083978-e6ae-4a5b-af96-f23257b4c6dd" facs="#m-4d70cbaa-ad8d-4568-9cb3-324f32dbb18a" label="lyrics-like">nos, quae ante lucem fuérunt ad</l><l xml:id="m-54344f98-4d71-410d-a2f8-820489569ed2" facs="#m-23771585-6ecc-4f2a-850d-64e558819f7d" label="lyrics-like">minus vere, et appáruit Simóni. Et</l><l xml:id="m-e8d70a4e-e611-4bc7-9755-fa868a46c4f1" facs="#m-2f6ff78e-c931-4ae4-9ac0-1e5b7a615f91" label="lyrics-like">ipsi narrábant quae gesta erant in</l><l xml:id="m-787fbef2-4850-4546-b90c-bf0320c3c100" facs="#m-2edb571e-b444-4733-bdb4-7568cefbfc50" label="lyrics-like">monuméntum, et non invénto cór¬</l><l xml:id="m-e580d154-1ebb-4610-931d-28fb797844f4" facs="#m-db6c6ae7-b397-4679-9259-4b90e31687c6" label="lyrics-like">pore ejus, venérunt, dicéntes se</l><l xml:id="m-c54c7ff0-4c68-48ce-876b-b7de6f60b849" facs="#m-2db10fd8-3cf4-4471-8733-313cf82935df" label="lyrics-like">via: et quómodo cognovérunt eum</l><l xml:id="m-43a7bc9d-6754-450f-a984-582e356f8038" facs="#m-716a9b80-6322-4692-af9b-46e003729cf0" label="ambiguous">Credo.</l><l xml:id="m-10015f27-e180-45b4-aaa7-5abb68159f0c" facs="#m-11dc6a9a-5940-4a41-962d-4fd74a4840ec" label="lyrics-like">étiam visiónem Angelórum vidisse, lin fractiỗne panis.</l><l xml:id="m-64903333-1776-465a-866d-8312542441a5" facs="#m-332b8da4-23f1-49ac-823c-1bb14219bb17" label="ambiguous">ofert.E</l><l xml:id="m-d0ac9d7f-c7bc-458d-96fa-01bef7b329f5" facs="#m-1d4cb9ac-6f1b-4bc5-8d69-efc4ce9b4d14" label="ambiguous">8.</l><l xml:id="m-ed6be2cf-e5c6-4036-8152-d646125c88a7" facs="#m-e855d382-2fe9-47a8-aac8-83de5d64a288" label="ambiguous">H</l><l xml:id="m-a5767a3b-6a41-433f-b4d6-7488405dbd58" facs="#m-af5ffa3d-7c10-4728-a23c-464c249c1f88" label="lyrics-like">lus"Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-a9b8610e-71ac-49ab-8385-d55d4f8b1cc8" facs="#m-ed8d1d5d-1fda-4156-94f9-57c7f71a2bb1" label="lyrics-like">mi-ni descén¬</l><l xml:id="m-6dd54cb1-6b72-4db5-8b2e-42577979cae6" facs="#m-d14266bf-2c04-41e6-b094-567701053ff2" label="lyrics-like">et dí¬</l><l xml:id="m-49baccbb-6f12-4477-88ce-d3ced7b6fb66" facs="#m-73945cf6-d9d0-4ac6-a325-b3237b11b611" label="lyrics-like">dit de caé¬</l><l xml:id="m-122e017d-9a35-4366-bcdb-26a4b30ee4fe" facs="#m-5fde524d-4195-4e8f-96f6-cd9285575dd9" label="ambiguous">lo,</l><l xml:id="m-22f621e2-e7dd-4dec-ba89-ccd610481035" facs="#m-4c05e977-2e42-4b02-aca6-523545bc4272" label="ambiguous">xit</l><l xml:id="m-338e74b6-30a9-44bc-a064-ba0a9ceb6362" facs="#m-28d04290-23c3-4bf3-8017-232ba43a93b0" label="lyrics-like">mudi-é¬</l><l xml:id="m-762a62b6-8dcd-4fdc-90f7-039b473aaa6f" facs="#m-d8eaf548-0911-43f2-a1cd-7441fc582836" label="ambiguous">ri-tis,</l><l xml:id="m-78d13390-cd0d-4874-9623-4687aa375b18" facs="#m-e1e83c6c-7038-4581-ba82-dce73aeb47f0" label="lyrics-like">ribus: Quem quaé¬</l><l xml:id="m-1863e88c-e52a-48c8-81c5-750d860752f4" facs="#m-88b8f3ad-70c0-43ff-88d0-e4d46fe22658" label="ambiguous">sur¬</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>